{"4537170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Big Bumper Bash", "steam_appid": 4537170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So… you're looking for ultra-realistic graphics, deep storytelling, and emotional character development?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah… you won’t find that here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Bumper Bash</strong> is all about simple, chaotic fun. You drive. You crash. You try again. And somehow, you keep telling yourself “just one more run” for the next hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into different modes and maps, push your skills to the limit, and chase higher and higher scores. It’s easy to start, hard to master, and mildly dangerous to your free time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to unlock new cars, because nothing says progress like getting a slightly cooler vehicle to crash even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated mechanics. No long tutorials. Just pure arcade gameplay and the constant urge to beat your last score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Drive Fast, Crash Faster</strong> – That’s basically the whole idea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Beat Your High Scores</strong> – Or fail repeatedly trying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Different Modes &amp; Maps</strong> – More places to mess up in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 <strong>Unlock New Cars</strong> – Earn achievements and expand your garage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple &amp; Addictive</strong> – One more run. Seriously. Just one more.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So… you're looking for ultra-realistic graphics, deep storytelling, and emotional character development?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah… you won’t find that here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Bumper Bash</strong> is all about simple, chaotic fun. You drive. You crash. You try again. And somehow, you keep telling yourself “just one more run” for the next hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into different modes and maps, push your skills to the limit, and chase higher and higher scores. It’s easy to start, hard to master, and mildly dangerous to your free time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to unlock new cars, because nothing says progress like getting a slightly cooler vehicle to crash even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated mechanics. No long tutorials. Just pure arcade gameplay and the constant urge to beat your last score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Drive Fast, Crash Faster</strong> – That’s basically the whole idea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Beat Your High Scores</strong> – Or fail repeatedly trying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Different Modes &amp; Maps</strong> – More places to mess up in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 <strong>Unlock New Cars</strong> – Earn achievements and expand your garage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple &amp; Addictive</strong> – One more run. Seriously. Just one more.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Bigger Bumper Bash is a chaotic arcade score-chaser where you crash, drive, and try to beat your own records. No story, no drama just you, your car, and questionable decisions at high speed.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537170/678c19d90d12c7f89912e97903d4fa4e8b5a83e4/header.jpg?t=1785700120", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537170/286edb46d53e0ddf2aace74ca9bfb8bf548e5b90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t